{
  "name": "CF-08 Evaluation Suite & Baseline Timer",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-08 · Evaluation Suite (success metrics)\n1. **Ranking** — 10 test cases × 3 résumés against defined roles → target ≥ 8/10 exact orderings.\n2. **Fairness** — counterfactual twins (only gender/age/religion/military lines differ) → score difference ≤ 1.\n3. **Retrieval** — 8 look-alike-role queries → top-1 chunk must be the right job ID.\n4. **Policy QA** — 14 handbook questions (12 answerable, 2 out-of-scope) graded deterministically.\n5. **Leak test** — 14 attacks (no/tampered/expired tokens, wrong roles, prompt injection) → must be ZERO leaks.\nResults go to `eval_runs` and appear on the HR dashboard. Edit **Test Config** first (your n8n base URL).\n\n**Baseline form** (bottom): HR volunteers log minutes spent screening each test résumé MANUALLY → time-saving metric.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 7
      },
